## Middleware que corre antes de las rutas, como `route-middleware` de Express.
import std.spark
import portus

## Añade una cabecera a toda respuesta.
weave tag with data as ref to void, context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
    calling context.set_header with "X-Ruta", "con-middleware"
    return calling portus.ok_void

## Una ruta normal.
weave home with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
    calling context.send_text with "con middleware"
    return calling portus.ok_void

weave main into int:
    var app as portus.Application is calling portus.new_application
    var mw as portus.Middleware is calling portus.middleware with tag
    calling portus.use with sigil of app, mw
    let added as result of void to portus.PatternError is calling portus.get with sigil of app, "/", home
    calling spark.println with "portus escuchando en http://127.0.0.1:3000"
    let served as result of int to string is calling portus.serve with sigil of app, 3000
    let bound as int is served or:
        return 1
    return 0
